If you are using a SharePoint List template, these are useful columns:
1

Ticket ID
Unique reference number, such as IT-001.

2

Title
Short issue description, e.g. Outlook access problem.

3

Description
Details of the issue or request.



4

Requested By
Employee who submitted the ticket.

5

Assigned To
IT expert responsible for the request.

6

Category
Hardware, Software, Network, Microsoft 365, Access, etc.

7

Priority
Low, Medium, High, or Critical.

8

Status
New, In Progress, On Hold, Resolved, or Closed.

9

Created Date
Date the ticket was submitted.

10

Resolution / Comments
Actions taken and the final solution.
